[[The Forbidding Sea]] is a largely unexplored portion of the [[Great Sea]] along the eastern coast of the [[Eastern Kingdoms]], sometimes noted by travelers on the coasts of [[the Hinterlands]] and [[Swamp of Sorrows]]. Most of these waters are made by many impassable mountain ranges on the long the eastern coast of the continent, [[east of Khaz Modan]].

